<title>POLAND: Debica up on good February earnings.</title>
<headline>Debica up on good February earnings.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish tyremaker Debica SA rose 4.9 percent to 85 zlotys in moderate trade on Thursday, the day after the firm announced it lifted February net profit to 5.5 million zlotys from 3.4 million a year ago, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;That's the second month in a row they posted good earnings,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Debica was the bourse's top gainer on Thursday when most stocks fell, several as much as nine percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
